1262..1321 Comment "/// A semigroup\'s one law: associativity overlaps itself at"
1322..1395 Comment "/// `mul(mul(mul(a, b), c), d)`, and both ways round reach `mul(a, mul(b,"
1396..1470 Comment "/// mul(c, d)))`. The rewrite at the peak matches the rule\'s `z` against a"
1471..1534 Comment "/// subterm holding the peak\'s own `z`, which stays the peak\'s."
